 "notes": "Provisional black-and-white map sheet (geology drawn on the 1983 topographic base); explanation 'not in stratagraphic order'. Symbols al, agn, gb, um and qtz read from the explanation on page images; OCR 'gamet' read as garnet. Some map-face areas are labelled 'gn?' (queried). No ages printed. The structure symbols (foliation, schistosity, cleavage, folds, thrust planes in exposure, breccia zones) on the map face are small and show dip numbers only, without printed strikes or locations; they were not recorded, and the black-and-white scan does not separate the thrust and fold line types reliably. No drill holes, cross section or references. SUBSURFACE: none.",
